{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1691.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"7de56b4a1652e07693f9c87b06a5a2abfd138bf3a812ec8ca1e81609b2f77d75","ja":"一時間後、3人はそれぞれ、\n雪の写真をSNSにあげて、控え室に戻ってきて……","zh":"一个小时后，3人各自\n把雪景照片发到社交平台后，回到了休息室……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1691.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c09b34ee6aaa44c6c103d205d3d3650eb9c6780e69e670b49715b09390e195c8","ja":"ふぅ……部屋に戻ってくると、ほっとしますね。","zh":"呼……回到房间里，就让人松了口气呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1691.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f11127838d5c139ffb57e41d172b1eae6ba0c7614056af4c92de0abbad100ae9","ja":"そうだね。体が冷えちゃってるから、\n風邪をひかないように、しっかりあたためよう。","zh":"也是呢。身体都冻透了，\n可别感冒了，好好暖和一下吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1691.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b30b317676729f44319ac5799d035d11c6856ebb0a3192353c23320d6207e6b8","ja":"春香さんは何を作ったんだい？　SNSの写真は……\nわぁ♪　雪うさぎがいっぱいだねぇ♪","zh":"春香做了什么呢？社交平台上的照片是……\n哇♪有好多雪兔呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1691.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"7f3b08f2ea336f7333d7aebf8efb03913cbdcc1fb62caf46b4f7401f1e220064","ja":"うん。なんだか夢中になっちゃって♪　あと、\nこっちの写真はSNSにあげてないんだけど……。","zh":"嗯。不知不觉就沉迷进去了♪　还有，\n这张照片我还没有发到社交平台上……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1691.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"bb6ef31522b72ea17bba886614f18868e6c042376887a533344773926d418cc9","ja":"女の子とのツーショット、ですか？\nこの子は誰なんです？","zh":"是和女孩子的合照吗？\n这孩子是谁啊？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1691.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"717da52755693d0efaded7cbb598ca5adc33bef314bbd53e148a5e85ac6de392","ja":"通りかかった子に、「ひとつください」って\n言われたの。写真はお母さんが撮ってくれたんだよ。","zh":"路过的小朋友对我说“请给我一个”。\n照片是妈妈帮忙拍的哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1691.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"408f75c27713d4693cec005fe730870aae7624b5678931d318b6be847b526973","ja":"春香さん、雪うさぎ屋さんになったんだねぇ♪\nあたしも、ほしいなぁ。","zh":"春香成了雪兔摊老板了呢♪\n我也想要一只呀。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1691.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"968069163e4357640da8d01d55fe845e45110542bf5bd5b5c15ed95e1ac09728","ja":"ふふ、もちろんどうぞ♪\n静香ちゃんの写真も見ていい？","zh":"呵呵，当然可以♪\n我也可以看看静香的照片吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
